WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:05.580
The final season of Game of Thrones is here,
and there’s a lot to remember from the last

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.000
sixty-seven episodes.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.430
Who’s fighting who, who’s related to who,
and who’s having sex even though they’re

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.430
related?

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:15.480
What’s going on in Thrones Season 8?

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:20.929
Basically, Jon Snow and Daenerys and almost
every other character are united against the

00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:23.800
white walkers and their army of the dead.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.900
But in the south, Cersei Lannister has the
Throne.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.169
She said she’d help the good guys, but she
lied, and she’s got Euron bringing her an

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:33.330
army to help her hold power.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:38.010
Cersei’s brother-lover Jaime has left her
to help fight the dead.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:42.070
Theon is trying to rescue his sister Yara
from their uncle Euron.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.100
Melisandre’s off in the east.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.790
And Hot Pie’s kickin it in the riverlands.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:52.630
So how’d everyone get here – what are
their motivations, conflicts and relationships?

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:57.370
Jon Snow was a misfit bastard at Winterfell
. He joined the Night’s Watch, and became

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:59.520
a heroic and principled leader.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.799
He’s made sacrifices for the greater good
– giving up his love, his pride, and his

00:01:04.799 --> 00:01:05.799
life.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:07.299
Now, he’s King in the North.

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:11.990
He’s sworn to serve Daenerys, and they’re
ready to fight the white walkers together.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:16.319
But Jon and Daenerys are in love, which’ll
get awkward , because they’re about to find

00:01:16.319 --> 00:01:22.729
out that Daenerys is Jon’s aunt , and Jon
is the rightful king ahead of her . How will

00:01:22.729 --> 00:01:25.299
Jon balance love and duty?

00:01:25.299 --> 00:01:29.039
And what more will Jon have to sacrifice to
save the world?

00:01:29.039 --> 00:01:34.399
Jon’s sister Sansa helps him rule Winterfell,
but there is tension, cause they don’t agree

00:01:34.399 --> 00:01:40.100
on all his decisions . Jon’s favourite sister
was always Arya, and soon they’ll finally

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.460
reunite.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:47.999
Jon is close friends with Sam , and Edd, he’s
friendly with Tyrion, and Davos is his advisor.

00:01:47.999 --> 00:01:53.869
Jon also has a special doggo who we almost
never see because he’s tricky to film.

00:01:53.869 --> 00:01:58.689
Melisandre said that Jon is the prince that
was promised , a hero prophesied to defeat

00:01:58.689 --> 00:02:04.869
the darkness with a flaming sword . She also
said Daenerys has a role to play, which, the

00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:08.130
prophecy suggests, might involve sacrifice.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:14.020
Daenerys Targaryen was a meek abused girl
, til she embraced the power of the Dothraki

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:19.690
, and the magic of her Targaryen blood . She
got three dragons, conquered Slaver’s Bay,

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:25.980
and learned to be a queen – balancing peace
and compromise against violence and fire . Daenerys

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:31.250
has compassion for the weak , she liberates
thousands of slaves . And now she wants to

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:36.940
claim the Throne of Westeros , and build a
better world . But how can she win her war

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:42.810
without killing thousands , and being a tyrant
like her father ? Her war is further complicated

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:46.680
by the zombie apocalypse, and by her hot nephew.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:51.070
Daenerys keeps saying that she can’t have
children , which probably means she’ll have

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.770
a baby with Jon.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:58.920
Daenerys’ closest friends and advisors are
Missandei and Jorah, aka Ser Friendzone.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:05.530
She also has Tyrion and Varys who she doesn’t
entirely trust . Daenerys has an army of Unsullied

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:10.850
and Dothraki, and only two dragons now, because
one of them was taken by the white walkers.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:16.930
Daenerys has wanted to rule Westeros for seven
seasons now – but will she ever win the

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:17.930
Throne?

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:22.690
In a vision in Season 2, she reaches for the
Throne but never takes it.

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:28.290
Cersei Lannister was always frustrated trying
to be a powerful woman in a patriarchal world

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:33.530
. She was married to a drunk violent idiot,
when her true love was her twin brother Jaime

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:37.410
[a handsome violent idiot] . Cersei learned
to be ruthless and manipulative to protect

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:42.730
her children and her power . Cersei hates
her brother Tyrion, especially once he murders

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.470
their father Tywin.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:50.600
Cersei’s jealousy and paranoia brings about
her downfall, so she strikes back with fiery

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:56.680
vengeance – killing hundreds of innocents,
torturing her enemies, and taking the Throne.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:00.850
All her children are dead now, and her lover
Jaime is gone.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:06.750
So all Cersei has left is the Throne, and
her grief, and her hate, and her unborn child

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:10.090
. Euron Greyjoy is bringing her an army.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:14.650
And she’s got the mad scientist Qyburn and
the murder-zombie Mountain.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.680
Can Cersei hold the Throne, or will she self-destruct?

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:23.240
There’s a prophecy that Cersei will be cast
down by someone younger and more beautiful

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:28.470
– which could be Daenerys, or maybe Sansa
or Brienne.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:32.640
In the books, the prophecy says that Cersei
will be killed by her brother – so she might

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.950
be killed by Jaime.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:37.170
Or maybe by Arya wearing Jaime’s face.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.960
Jaime Lannister began as an arrogant violent
villain.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:46.639
He pushed Bran from a window to hide his incest
with Cersei, and he attacked Ned Stark.

00:04:46.639 --> 00:04:51.040
But then Jaime got captured, and lost his
sword-hand, and Brienne taught him honour

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.220
and humility.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:57.350
We learned Jaime’s backstory – that he
killed his king to save a city, but was hated

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:03.490
for breaking his oaths . Jaime wants to redeem
himself, achieve deeds worthy of the White

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:08.520
Book – so he sent Brienne to help Sansa
and Arya, and tried to save his daughter Myrcella

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:14.500
. And finally, Jaime has left his lifelong
lover Cersei, and rides north to help fight

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:19.500
the white walkers . Jaime might not be very
welcome at Winterfell.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:24.380
Because Jaime crippled Bran, and warred against
the Starks, and killed Daenerys’ father,

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.760
the Mad King.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:30.550
His relationship with Tyrion is also difficult,
since Tyrion killed their father.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:36.430
Jaime said he wants to die in the arms of
the woman he loves . So will he die with Cersei?

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.460
Or is Brienne his true love?

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:46.770
Tyrion Lannister always felt unloved and unappreciated
– using his wits and wealth to protect himself.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:50.860
He found love with Shae, and enjoyed having
power in King’s Landing.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:56.760
But the hatred of his father Tywin, and of
Cersei and Joffrey, led to him kill his father

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.070
and his lover.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:02.180
Tyrion was depressed and hopeless until he
met Daenerys.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:07.580
Tyrion believes in Daenerys, and her dream
of a better world . But Daenerys wages war

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:13.949
against Tyrion’s family, so Tyrion’s loyalties
are torn . Tyrion is friendly with Jon, and

00:06:13.949 --> 00:06:14.949
with Varys.

00:06:14.949 --> 00:06:17.199
He’s mates with Bronn and Podrick.

00:06:17.199 --> 00:06:23.130
He was briefly in an arranged marriage to
Sansa, and they seem to respect each other.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:28.889
But his brother Jaime is still mad that Tyrion
killed their dad, and his sister Cersei despises

00:06:28.889 --> 00:06:29.889
him.

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:32.831
Tyrion desperately wants a peace with his
siblings.

00:06:32.831 --> 00:06:37.010
Cause if Tyrion’s family doesn’t love
him, who will?

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:42.000
Sansa Stark once dreamed of being a queen
and marrying a handsome prince – but she

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.150
was soon disillusioned.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:50.570
She became a political pawn, beaten and abused
by Joffrey then Ramsay . But gradually, Sansa

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:55.500
learned politics from some of the most devious
players in the game – like Littlefinger,

00:06:55.500 --> 00:07:02.100
Olenna and Cersei . Sansa helped take back
Winterfell, and enjoys having political power.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:06.970
So how will she react when Daenerys and Jon
threaten that power?

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:11.970
Sansa is friends with her sister Arya, after
a shaky reunion last season.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:15.000
And Brienne is sworn to serve and protect
her.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:20.889
Sansa will soon reunite with ex-husband Tyrion,
and with the Hound – who was kind to her

00:07:20.889 --> 00:07:22.420
in the capital.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:27.680
Arya Stark was a tomboy who didn’t fit in
the role of a noble lady.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:33.010
She got separated from her family, and her
identity, and saw terrible suffering and injustice.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:39.050
Her mentors were killers, each more deadly
than the last – Syrio Forel, the Hound,

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:40.610
and Jaqen H’ghar.

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:45.520
The Faceless Men trained her to fight, and
wear faces as magical disguises.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:50.530
But she rejected their religion, and returned
to her identity as a Stark.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:55.250
Arya wants revenge on the people who hurt
her family, and Cersei and the Mountain are

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.600
on her list.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.810
She’ll also help fight the white walkers
and the dead.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:05.250
But the more Arya kills for anger and hate,
the more she’s separated from her family

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:11.080
– she’s become distant, and suspicious,
and threatened to kill her sister.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:15.960
Can Arya find peace and love, or only blood
and death?

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:20.889
She will finally reunite with Jon – and
probably with the Hound, and Gendry.

00:08:20.889 --> 00:08:26.090
Gendry liked to call Arya “my lady” , they
could have a relationship.

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:31.340
But Arya is fiercely independent – she said
she’d like to go explore the world . Arya’s

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:36.039
direwolf Nymeria is still out there, leading
a wolf pack – maybe they’ll help in the

00:08:36.039 --> 00:08:38.330
battles to come.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:44.150
Bran Stark used to be a happy kid, who dreamed
of being a knight – until Jaime pushed him

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:46.730
from a tower, crippling him.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:50.510
Jojen Meera and Hodor journeyed with Bran
to the three-eyed raven – who taught him

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:55.790
to have visions of future and past, and to
warg into the minds of other creatures.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:09:03.279
But power came at a cost – Jojen and Hodor
and Summer died, and Bran damaged Hodor through

00:09:03.279 --> 00:09:05.380
some timey wimey stuff.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:10.130
Bran became the new three-eyed raven, and
kinda lost his personality, he’s become

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:15.320
cold and weird, disconnected from his sisters
Sansa and Arya.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:19.140
His powers will be important in the fight
against the white walkers.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:23.880
He might warg into a dragon, or have important
visions, or have a psychic battle with the

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:24.880
Night King.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:30.350
There are theories about Bran being the Night
King in some time loop, which might be cool,

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.350
or dumb.

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:34.430
But will Bran ever be Bran again?

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:36.680
Bran has no memory of his fall.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:41.560
But Jaime is returning to Winterfell – maybe
seeing the man who pushed him will remind

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.630
Bran of the boy he used to be.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:46.899
Theon Greyjoy just wanted to belong.

00:09:46.899 --> 00:09:52.230
He never fit in as a Greyjoy at Winterfell
, so he betrayed the Starks – attacked the

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:58.330
family that raised him , and killed innocent
kids . He was captured by Ramsay, who tortured

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:04.110
him, castrated him, and took away his very
identity . But then Theon helped Sansa escape

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:06.980
Winterfell, and joined Daenerys with his sister
Yara.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:12.640
Theon is still traumatised, but he now hopes
to face his fears and to rescue Yara from

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:16.800
their uncle Euron, just as Yara once tried
to rescue him.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:20.260
Theon says that his crimes are beyond forgiveness.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:26.240
But what is dead can never die, and Theon
might still have the strength to do some good.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:31.560
Yara is a warrior and a leader who wants to
be the first queen of the Iron Islands.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:36.600
As for Euron, he’s a scary eldritch pirate
sorcerer king in the books, but in the show

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:40.700
he mostly just wants to wear leather and pork
Cersei.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:46.390
Brienne struggled to find a place for herself
in a world that didn’t accept female warriors.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:52.089
She felt that she failed King Renly, and failed
Catelyn Stark . But then Brienne avenged Renly,

00:10:52.089 --> 00:10:57.720
and helped protect Catelyn’s daughters Sansa
and Arya . Brienne has finally found success

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:03.660
and respect, and now more than ever, Brienne
knows who she is, as she joins the fight against

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.350
the white walkers.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.730
Brienne almost killed the Hound one time,
but they’re cool.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.279
And Tormund has a giant crush on her.

00:11:11.279 --> 00:11:15.960
But her closest bond is with Jaime – they
taught each other to be better versions of

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.160
themselves.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:22.280
Will they become lovers, or die together,
or just remain close friends?

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:27.220
Brienne’s loyal squire Podrick has been
training at combat – maybe he’ll do something

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:30.370
heroic, and finally be made a knight.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.320
Also, Pod fucks.

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:37.740
Jorah was exiled from Westeros for selling
slaves . Shamed and disillusioned , he originally

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:40.610
spied on Daenerys, and almost got her killed.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:46.279
But seeing Dany’s power and her dragons
inspired Jorah – he became totally loyal

00:11:46.279 --> 00:11:51.970
and in love with Daenerys . She did exile
him a couple times – for his earlier betrayal,

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.980
and for his gross skin condition.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.899
But now, Jorah’s loyalty is unquestioned.

00:11:56.899 --> 00:12:03.380
He’s even accepted that Dany loves Jon not
him . Jorah is willing to die for Dany , and

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.220
he probably will.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:11.800
Jorah is grateful to Sam, who cured his greyscale,
and Jorah now wields Sam’s family Valyrian

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:12.800
sword.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:17.290
Also Lyanna Mormont is Jorah’s niece – she
might not be happy with her deadbeat uncle

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.339
coming home.

00:12:19.339 --> 00:12:23.440
Sam Tarly was a misfit and a coward, rejected
by his father.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:29.260
But Jon helped find him a place at the Night’s
Watch, and eventually to study at the Citadel.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:34.730
Sam found the courage to kill a white walker
– and to stand up to his dad.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:40.010
Gilly grew up in the cruelty of Craster’s
Keep – Sam was the first to treat her with

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:44.630
kindness, and helped Gilly flower into a bright
and more confident woman.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:49.850
They found unlikely love in one another, and
Sam adopted Gilly’s baby as his own.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:54.720
Though, that baby was originally promised
to the white walkers – and the walkers might

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.560
want him back.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:13:01.990
As Jon’s closest friend, Sam plans to break
the news that Jon is heir to the Throne, and

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:05.170
is the nephew of his girlfriend.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:09.600
The red woman, Melisandre, is a priestess
of the Lord of Light.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:13.610
She once believed that Stannis would save
the world , and she did all sorts of fucked

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.250
up magic for him.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.720
But then Stannis died, throwing Mel into doubt
and depression.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:25.410
We saw her at her most vulnerable – turns
out that Melisandre is ancient, and uses magic

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.690
to hide it.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:31.540
But then Mel resurrected Jon Snow, restoring
her faith.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.230
She now believes that Jon and Daenerys are
the chosen ones.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:40.190
She’s gone east to Volantis, maybe to bring
help from other red priests.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:46.290
Melisandre said that she’ll return to Westeros,
and die there . Jon and Davos both promised

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:51.300
to kill Melisandre if she returns, because
Mel burned Davos’ friend Shireen.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:57.019
So maybe Mel will die as she lived – with
fire, magic, and blood.

00:13:57.019 --> 00:14:02.430
Also Melisandre once met Arya, and said that
she’d see her again.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:08.080
Varys grew up on the streets, and his cock
and balls were cut off by a wizard – so

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:13.130
he’s not a big fan of magic , or people
who use it, like Melisandre.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:15.519
Varys was spymaster for King Robert.

00:14:15.519 --> 00:14:20.639
But he secretly supported the Targaryens . Varys
wants a ruler who will protect the people

00:14:20.639 --> 00:14:25.721
, and he believes that Daenerys is the best
hope for peace . But he has said he’ll stop

00:14:25.721 --> 00:14:29.020
supporting Dany if she stops being a good
queen.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:34.990
And Daenerys promised to burn him if he betrays
her . Melisandre said that Varys will die

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:39.110
in Westeros .
When the Hound was a boy, his brother the

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:45.399
Mountain burned his face – scarring him
for life, and giving him a fear of fire . The

00:14:45.399 --> 00:14:51.730
Hound feels betrayed and alone , and hides
this with violence and hate . The Hound found

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:56.420
a kindred spirit in Arya, then he was almost
killed by Brienne.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:15:01.180
The Hound returned, and was offered a chance
at redemption – to do some good in the world

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:06.060
. Beric and Thoros tell him that the Lord
of Light has a plan for them all.

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:10.700
The Hound starts to show some compassion . And
he helps the heroes fight beyond the Wall.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:16.050
But the Hound has unfinished business with
the Mountain . Maybe he’ll overcome his

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:20.350
fear of fire to kill his brother, and put
his demons to rest.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.980
&lt;airhorns&gt;
Grey Worm and Missandei were slaves, dehumanised

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:28.640
and abused until Daenerys won their freedom
and their loyalty.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:33.040
Grey Worm leads Dany’s Unsullied, and Missandei
is her closest advisor.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:38.750
Gradually, they’ve learned to live and love
freely, despite the trauma of their past.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.990
But loving means having something to lose.

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:46.399
Maybe Grey Worm or Missandei will die next
season.

00:15:46.399 --> 00:15:49.240
Bronn was once an opportunistic killer.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:55.079
Now he’s a rich opportunistic killer, thanks
to Tyrion and Jaime . But after everything

00:15:55.079 --> 00:16:00.329
he’s done for the Lannisters, Bronn wants
a bigger reward – he wants a castle . Cersei

00:16:00.329 --> 00:16:03.589
did give him one once, but then she took it
back off him.

00:16:03.589 --> 00:16:06.700
And now, Tyrion has asked Bronn to join him
again.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:11.579
Tyrion says he’ll “pay double” . So
one cool theory is that Bronn will get the

00:16:11.579 --> 00:16:15.410
Twins – the two Frey castles linked across
a river.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:20.330
The Twins are conveniently vacant, since Arya
killed the Freys last season.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:24.780
So maybe Bronn of all people will get his
happily ever after.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:29.340
Beric Dondarrion believes that he has a special
destiny for the Lord of Light.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.630
He’s been killed then resurrected six times.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:37.820
But now that his priest Thoros is dead, Beric’s
on his “last life” .

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:41.660
Tormund fights for the survival of his people,
the wildlings.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:45.770
He also hopes to win the heart of his beloved
Brienne.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:51.550
Davos was a smuggler, a common man who rose
to be advisor to Stannis, and then to Jon.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:57.720
He’s consistently a voice of reason, telling
leaders to the right thing, not the easy thing.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:03.269
He’s no-nonsense, and no-drama – he barely
ever mentions that Tyrion blew up his son.

00:17:03.269 --> 00:17:07.350
However, he is furious at Melisandre for killing
Shireen.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:09.750
And he’s also very fond of Gendry.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:13.020
Gendry is the bastard son of King Robert.

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:15.820
He’s a blacksmith, and he can swing a hammer
good.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:21.059
He’s got decent rowing form, excellent cardio,
and possibly a crush on Arya.

00:17:21.059 --> 00:17:26.250
He’ll be forging special weapons to fight
the dead.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:32.220
The white walkers are a mysterious looming
threat – an ancient force of winter and

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:33.220
darkness.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:37.750
They were originally created by the children
of the forest, to defend the children from

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:43.580
humans – but the walkers apparently got
out of control, and now threaten all life.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:48.150
The walkers can raise the dead as mindless
zombies called wights.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:52.200
The walkers can be killed with dragonglass
or Valyrian steel.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:56.940
And the wights can be killed with fire, glass,
steel, or basically anything.

00:17:56.940 --> 00:18:02.360
The walkers and wights are led by the Night
King, the first white walker, who also seems

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.490
connected to magic like Bran.

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:08.040
We don’t know exactly what the white walkers
want.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:13.049
We know they turn human babies into more white
walkers, and make symbols out of corpses.

00:18:13.049 --> 00:18:17.040
So there might be more to learn about the
walkers before the end.

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:21.940
The white walkers have taken one of Daenerys’
dragons, and have at least a hundred thousand

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:24.410
dead soldiers – they seem unstoppable.

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:30.200
But Beric reckons that if the Night King is
killed, all the walkers and wights will fall

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:36.320
. There are connections between the white
walkers and the Starks – go watch this video.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:40.760
Finally, Hot Pie has been chillin n killin
since Season 1.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:46.059
He’s survived Harrenhal, and the brotherhood,
and his baking’s only got better.

00:18:46.059 --> 00:18:50.620
Hot Pie’s a survivor, and he’ll prolly
outlive the rest of them.

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:55.270
So that’s where everyone’s at the beginning
of the end of Game of Thrones.

